<title>JAPAN: Japan's Jan household spending down 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan's Jan household spending down 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's household spending in January fell 0.3 percent in real terms from a year earlier to an average of 324,913 yen per household, the government's Management and Coordination Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of year-on-year percentage changes in household spending in real and nominal terms:</p>
<p>						Dec		   Nov</p>
<p>					 Real   Nominal    Real   Nominal</p>
<p> Overall household spending    -0.3    +0.1	-0.6    -0.1</p>
<p>(average 324,913 yen)</p>
<p> Spending by wage earners	+2.7    +3.1	-0.8    -0.3</p>
<p>(average 352,098 yen)</p>
</text>
